# Commands run by the launchd job com.redwood.demo (RC_JOBS=rc.jobs.metaldraw0).
#
# Slice 0 of the fragment-shader sweep: shaders 0..59 of
# AppleMetalGLRenderer's library, drawn through the Metal driver, one line each.
#
# Why slices: the loader keeps the first 256 KB of a boot's log and the last 1 MB and drops
# the middle, and the boot's own noise fills most of that first 256 KB -- so about seventy
# lines of sweep survive per boot. Two single-boot runs stopped at exactly 64 shaders and the
# limit looked like the driver's until the line number gave it away (2572 of 11480).
/redwood/bin/metal_drv_test --draw-all 0 60 /System/Library/Extensions/AppleMetalGLRenderer.bundle/default.metallib
